              "document_hash": "c58e1b7c61a65c49f2b7fcd66c2f2cd20dc8529dfa400064347d37b4ade651df",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c58e1b7c61a6-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 12,
                "start": 12
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Pirani argues that \u201csuch security\u201d should be read to include securities not directly traceable to a defective registration statement but having a minimal relationship to it, allowing his case to proceed."
        }
